---
import WhatsAppButton from "./WhatsAppButton.astro";
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background glow (2 blobs: purple + cyan) -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
    <div data-parallax="-0.06" class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/3 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[400px] bg-purple/20 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div data-parallax="-0.1" class="absolute top-1/2 right-0 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[300px] bg-cyan/10 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
    <div class="fade-in rounded-3xl bg-white/[0.05] backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/10 p-10 sm:p-14">
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl mb-6">
        Quer saber se automação ou IA funciona
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple to-cyan bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          pro seu negócio?
        </span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray text-lg mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Me chama no WhatsApp. Sem compromisso, sem enrolação. Você sai com um diagnóstico claro do que pode melhorar.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <WhatsAppButton text="Chamar no WhatsApp" />
        <a
          href="#servicos"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-display font-semibold text-white border border-white/20 rounded-full px-8 py-4 text-lg hover:bg-white/5 transition-all duration-300 whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Ver Serviços
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray/60 text-sm mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
        <span>Resposta em &lt; 24h</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">·</span>
        <span>100% gratuito</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">·</span>
        <span>Vagas limitadas</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
